4.1  The Licensor grants You a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive,
     perpetual license, irrevocable except as Section 8.2 provides, to
     make Agent-Authored Derived Works, through Agents, with software
     that only transforms content (Section 1.2), or by removals under
